{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1310519001:1":{"text":"Hello, can you hear us? We're not Hypogeans, we're the good guys!","source_cn":"喂，你们能听到我讲话吗？我们不是恶魔，也不是坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F8AE61C60130D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310519002:1":{"text":"We saw everything! You saved those two children, you're heroes!","source_cn":"我们都看到了，你们救了那两个小孩子，你们是英雄的战士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F4BC19947B2DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310519003:1":{"text":"Protect... and fight the... Hypogeans...","source_cn":"保护他们……和恶魔……战斗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD4073F49034C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310519004:1":{"text":"We must... never back down...","source_cn":"绝不能……后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180D8255E61EBFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1310519004":{"text":"We must... never back down...","source_cn":"绝不能……后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180D8255E61EBFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310519005:1":{"text":"I see. These visions come from their powerful desires that linger here!","source_cn":"我明白了，刚才看到的幻象就是他们强烈的执念所留存下来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A19B536FFCC6BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310519006:1":{"text":"Even after all this time, they're still thinking about protecting those children...","source_cn":"就算他们死去了那么久，也还想着要保护那些小孩子呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425EA1E2D2C0CDFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310519009:1":{"text":"Gone...? Have we... already passed...?","source_cn":"死……我们……死了……？……我们……已经死了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E2855BE8C3BD98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310519010:1":{"text":"War... did we win? What about the Hypogeans...?","source_cn":"战争……胜利了吗？恶魔呢……恶魔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AED39B145B7BC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310519011:1":{"text":"Don't worry, you won! The Hypogeans have been sealed away.","source_cn":"放心吧，你们胜利了！恶魔也被封印起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A033181A0E8182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310519012:1":{"text":"And even though it's been two thousand years, the people here haven't forgotten you. They hold a grand festival every year to honor your sacrifice!","source_cn":"而且就算过了两千年，这里的人们也没有忘记你们呢，他们每...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE81548D7F37152","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310519013:1":{"text":"Ah... we really won... we've fought... for too long...","source_cn":"啊……胜利了……胜利了啊……我们等了……太久了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DD4C34412A0549B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310519014:1":{"text":"We won... finally... thank you...","source_cn":"终于胜利了……终于……谢谢你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83CAAA661C79EC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1310519015:1":{"text":"... <style=\"highlight\">Bring those weapons and follow us</style>...","source_cn":"……<style=highlight>带上那些武器，随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA4E17997B944BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"This is their lingering desire.","source_cn":"这是他们的执念","status":"matched_runtime_